<title>USA: Strouds March same store sales fall.</title>
<headline>Strouds March same store sales fall.</headline>
<dateline>CITY OF INDUSTRY, Calif. 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Strouds Inc Thursday said it had net sales of approximately $20.7 million for the five week period ended April 5, compared with approximately $19.3 million for the March reporting period last year, and same store sales for the March 1997 period decreased by approximately 4.7 percent.</p>
</text>
